DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nRetirement Planning – Never too early Never too lat
	e (Hong Kong)\nSynopsis\n:\nEveryone wishes a retirement with quality of l
	ife or even early retired! When & How should i do for planning my excellen
	t retirement life? What should I do now?\nThis webinar will share you what
	 you have to take into consideration for your retirement planning\, and al
	so some products/practices about retirement tools in HK market along with 
	the available solutions/products in DBS with preferential exclusive staff 
	offer!\nSpeakers\n:\nDBS Speaker:\nEdward Hui\, Vice President\nBancassura
	nce Team\n \nManulife Speakers: \nRon Tsang\, Senior Manager\nManulife Bus
	iness Academy\nHK Bancassurance\nCandy Chan\, Senior Manager\nPartnership 
	Distribution\n \n\n\n_____________________________________________________
	_________________________________________________________\n\nOption 1 – 
	If you are joining via a laptop or mobile device through the application:\
	n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs
	/j.php?MTID=mf40c3ee18038c002d3224d1c62fd473d> \n2. Use a headset for a be
	tter experience\n*Visit here <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/
	SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?market=Singapore&category=Communication> 
	to find out more about Webex \n\nMeeting password: dyDk9nYbt54 (only if as
	ked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the T
	ouch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Call" icon\n2. Dial 25187153931@dbs.w
	ebex.com <mailto:25187153931@dbs.webex.com>  into the search bar and press
	 "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. C
	lick here to see how to retrieve your Host KEY <https://dbs1bank.sharepoin
	t.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared%20Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites
	%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FG
	uides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D4
	2f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FG
	uides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a laptop through th
	e Web browser: \nFor external parties who do not wish to download the appl
	ication \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webe
	x.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=mf40c3ee18038c002d3224d1c62fd473d> \n2. Click on ‘C
	ancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Join f
	rom your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address and join the me
	eting \n\nClick here <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a
	-Webex-Meeting#id_135013> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dial
	ling in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges may
	 apply.\nNote if you are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to sta
	rt the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23
	> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\,
	 Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, H
	yderabad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +
	886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 
	2518 715 3931#\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalca
	llin.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team! <mai
	lto:webexsupport@dbs.com> \n \n
